TYPES.md §10.2, §4.1, §9.1, DECISIONS 456: whether "9" is a key literal of `ref ks` reads the leaf of ks's chain of ref keys, `ref J` then J's String key; `ref J` resolves at level 2 among the package's lets, `x` among them, so the unannotated `x` whose inference reads that leaf while `ref J` is still resolving is E3008, as a one-level read of a resolving target is.
